<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasInstall> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The `from` Element has each `to` Artifact installed (placed into position for use) into it during a LifecycleScopeType period. To express the Agent doing the install, link this relationship as the `from` in `performedBy`."@en .
